        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you... \r\n\r\n4-bedroom, 3-bathroom semi-detached family home\r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present 14 The Golf Road to the Skerries property market.\r\n\r\nNestled in one of Skerries' most sought-after residential locations, 14 Golf Links Road is a beautifully presented four-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached family home that has been thoughtfully updated and meticulously maintained by its current owners. Boasting generous living accommodation, an integrated garage, off-street parking and a large private rear garden, this exceptional home offers the perfect blend of comfort, style and practicality.\r\n\r\nNot overlooked to the front of the property.\r\n\r\nOn arrival, a spacious driveway provides ample off-street parking and leads to the extended entrance porch, with the integrated garage conveniently positioned to the side.\r\n\r\nStepping inside, you are welcomed by a bright and spacious entrance hallway, flooded with natural light and creating an immediate sense of space. To the left is access to the integrated garage, currently utilised as a practical laundry and storage area, while to the right lies the elegant living room. This inviting space features a charming fireplace with a wood-burning stove and enjoys an abundance of natural light. French doors lead seamlessly into the dining room, where a stunning floor-to-ceiling picture window perfectly frames the beautifully landscaped rear garden, creating a wonderful connection between the indoor and outdoor spaces.\r\n\r\nReturning to the hallway, there is a convenient guest WC, while to the rear of the property is the spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area. Designed with family living and entertaining in mind, the kitchen offers an excellent range of fitted base and eye-level units, providing ample storage and workspace. A rear door leads directly onto the patio and generous rear garden, making this an ideal space for summer entertaining, family gatherings or simply relaxing in complete privacy.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a striking double-height ceiling over the staircase, complemented by a large skylight, fills the landing with natural light and creates a wonderful architectural feature within the home.\r\n\r\nThe first floor comprises four generously proportioned double bedrooms. One of the front bedrooms benefits from dual windows, offering excellent flexibility as a home office, dressing room or potential walk-in wardrobe. The spacious principal bedroom is bright and airy and features fitted wardrobes along with a modern en-suite shower room. The remaining two double bedrooms are equally well presented and enjoy excellent natural light.\r\n\r\nCompleting the accommodation is the recently renovated family bathroom, finished to a high standard and perfectly suited to modern family living.\r\n\r\nHaving been extensively updated throughout while being lovingly maintained by its current owners, this superb property is presented in turnkey condition and offers an exceptional opportunity for purchasers seeking a spacious family home in an established and highly desirable neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nGolf Links Road is one of Skerries' most desirable residential addresses, ideally positioned within easy reach of every amenity the vibrant coastal town has to offer. Residents enjoy convenient access to excellent primary and secondary schools, a wide selection of sporting clubs, cafés, restaurants and local shops, while the award-winning beaches, picturesque harbour and stunning coastal walks are all just minutes away.\r\n\r\nSkerries town centre is approximately 1.5 km from the property, with Skerries Harbour and the beautiful South Strand beach also within easy reach. Skerries Train Station is approximately 1.8 km away, providing regular commuter rail services to Dublin City Centre, while several Dublin Bus and Bus Éireann routes also serve the area. The M1 motorway and Dublin Airport are both easily accessible, making this an ideal location for commuters.\r\n\r\nCombining spacious accommodation, modern upgrades, exceptional privacy and an outstanding coastal location, 14 Golf Links Road represents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a forever family home in the heart of Skerries.\r\n\r\nFamilies are exceptionally well catered for, with an excellent selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools located within easy reach of the property.\r\n\r\nPrimary schools nearby include St. Patrick's Junior National School, St. Patrick's Senior National School, Holmpatrick National School, Scoil Réalt na Mara and St. Michael's House Special National School, offering a variety of educational options for growing families.\r\n\r\nSecondary education is equally well served by Skerries Community College, a modern co-educational school with an excellent reputation, while Lusk Community College, Balbriggan Community College, Ardgillan Community College and Bremore Educate Together Secondary School are all within a short drive.\r\n\r\nFor those pursuing third-level education, the property enjoys convenient access to Dublin city, with excellent rail and road links connecting to institutions including Dublin City University (DCU), Trinity College Dublin, Technological University Dublin (TU Dublin) and University College Dublin (UCD).\r\n\r\nThe area's excellent educational facilities, combined with its strong sense of community, safe environment and wealth of sporting and recreational amenities, make Skerries one of North Dublin's most desirable locations for families.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
